1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,355
Bizga raqib jamoa kerak!

2
00:00:02,375 --> 00:00:06,321
Mana — botda eng ko‘p XP to‘plagan o‘n bir futbolchimiz.

3
00:00:06,341 --> 00:00:07,978
Qarshi tomon esa bo‘sh.

4
00:00:08,098 --> 00:00:10,291
Har bir pozitsiya — bitta o‘rin.

5
00:00:10,311 --> 00:00:15,674
Izohga xohlagan pozitsiyangizni yozing — masalan, ST yoki CB.

6
00:00:15,694 --> 00:00:17,100
Obuna bo‘lish shart!

7
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:21,647
Har pozitsiyada eng ko‘p layk olgan izoh egasi — o‘sha o‘rinda o‘ynaydi!

8
00:00:21,667 --> 00:00:24,807
ZAMIN FK — muxlislar jamoasiga qarshi.

9
00:00:24,827 --> 00:00:26,867
Qani, o‘rningizni egallang!

